## 2. 实现内容

- 新增任务、成员、work item 三类显式枚举状态机；未知状态、同状态重复写和未列入矩阵的转换全部 fail closed。
- 新增 `AgentTaskStateService`/`AgentTaskStateServiceImpl`，所有方法显式接收 `tenantId + clientId`，不从 taskId/agentId 推导 scope。
- 任务状态使用 `agent_task_meta.task_version` 单 SQL CAS；成员和 work item 复用 B02 的 `version` CAS。CAS 影响 0 行统一返回明确 `VERSION_CONFLICT`，不静默覆盖。
- 新增成员与 work item 的原子组合转换。两个对象在任何写入前完成 scope、版本和状态校验；若第一次 CAS 成功而第二次 CAS 冲突，异常触发 Spring 事务整体回滚。
- 成员状态转换只更新成员自身；组合转换只更新成员和 work item，从不更新 task meta，因此成员 `done` 不会直接完成整项任务。
- task/member 转入 `blocked` 或 `failed` 必须提供非空原因。
- work item 的 claim-sensitive 转换在枚举中定义为合法领域边，但通用 B03 服务返回 `RESERVED_FOR_CLAIM_PROTOCOL`，禁止在没有 lease token/ownership 校验时进入或离开 `claimed`；实际领取、启动、过期回队列留给 B04。
- 未实现 Controller、UI、RabbitMQ、领域事件、task 聚合推导或数据库 Schema 变更。

## 3. 冻结的状态转换

### 3.1 Task

```text
open       -> planning | assigned | cancelled
planning   -> assigned | cancelled
assigned   -> running | blocked | cancelled
running    -> reviewing | blocked | failed | cancelled
blocked    -> running | failed | cancelled
reviewing  -> running | completed | failed | cancelled
completed  -> archived
failed     -> archived
cancelled  -> archived
archived   -> (none)
```

说明：`completed/failed/cancelled` 不可恢复到工作态，只允许单向归档；兼容原有 task meta 的 `open/assigned/running/completed/failed/archived`，并补入设计中的 `planning/reviewing/blocked/cancelled`。

### 3.2 Member

```text
invited  -> accepted | rejected
accepted -> working | left
working  -> done | blocked | failed | left
blocked  -> working | failed | left
done/rejected/failed/left -> (none)
```

### 3.3 Work item

```text
pending   -> ready | cancelled
ready     -> claimed | cancelled
claimed   -> running | ready | cancelled
running   -> blocked | submitted | failed | cancelled
blocked   -> ready | failed | cancelled
submitted -> completed | ready | cancelled
completed/failed/cancelled -> (none)
```

其中所有 source/target 涉及 `claimed` 的边均由 B04 专用 claim 协议执行；B03 通用服务会拒绝这些边，防止绕过 lease 约束。

